<h1>Subscription Canceled ⏳</h1>
<p>Hello {{name}},</p>
<p>This email confirms that your subscription to <strong>QuickLink {{planName}}</strong> has been canceled.</p>

<p>Your premium features will remain fully active until the end of your billing cycle on <strong>{{accessUntil}}</strong>.</p>

<p><strong>After {{accessUntil}}:</strong></p>
<ul class="bullet-list">
  <li>Your account will downgrade back to the <strong>Free Plan</strong>.</li>
  <li>All your existing shortened links will remain active (subject to Free plan expiry limits).</li>
  <li>Your analytics history, bulk shortening, and custom codes configuration will be locked.</li>
</ul>

<div style="text-align: center;">
  <a href="{{appUrl}}/billing" class="btn">Reactivate Subscription Plan</a>
</div>

<p style="margin-top: 24px;">We are sorry to see you go! If you have a moment, please let us know how we can improve our services by replying directly to this email.</p>
<p>Best regards,<br>The QuickLink Team</p>
